# High-risk + infrastructure paths designate the maintainer as code owner.
# NOTE: enforcement (branch-protection `require_code_owner_reviews`) is DEFERRED
# to the auto-merge-enablement phase — turning it on now would break the existing
# Dependabot auto-merge on .github/ (actions) and src csproj (nuget) bumps. This
# file is in place so enforcement is a one-setting flip when auto-merge is enabled.
/src/                     @danielsimonjr
/.github/                 @danielsimonjr
/tests/                   @danielsimonjr
/*.sln                    @danielsimonjr
/Directory.Build.props    @danielsimonjr
/global.json              @danielsimonjr
/nuget.config             @danielsimonjr
/legacy/                  @danielsimonjr
/bundle/                  @danielsimonjr
